# The video in one take: every move on a bar's downbeat, the sections on the phrases (eight bars), so
# the music runs unbroken and the edit only cuts between the three framings (tools/make_film.sh 00-take).
# Each `bar` prints the film's time there: the cue sheet for build/video-script.md.
splash 0
wav 00-take.wav
film 00-take.film
bar 0 OPEN: the launch screen; the music starts
splashrun
bar 1 1. IT PLAYS ITSELF: the ripples
bar 8 HOME: the scope
tap HOME
bar 12 HOME: the spectrum
tap HOME
bar 16 HOME: the ripples again
tap HOME
bar 17 2. PERFORM: SEL, the knobs a mixer
tap SEL
bar 18 KNOB 2: the pings up
turn K2 12 60
bar 20 white 4: the kick muted
tapkey w3
bar 21 white 4: the kick back
tapkey w3
spin K4 -35
expect par3 65
bar 22 black 3 and 4: the bass and the kick soloed
tapkey b2
tapkey b3
bar 24 the solos off; white 7 held: THROW
tapkey b2
tapkey b3
key w6 down
bar 26 white 8 held: OPEN
key w6 up
key w7 down
bar 28 white 9 held: SHUT
key w7 up
key w8 down
bar 30 white 10 held: DROP (the kick and the bass)
key w8 up
key w9 down
bar 32 white 11 held: ECHO
key w9 up
key w10 down
bar 34 let go
key w10 up
bar 35 SEL: PERFORM off
tap SEL
bar 36 3. DUB HOLD: a tap on REC
tap REC
bar 40 REC: let go
tap REC
bar 41 REC held: the effects grid
press REC
bar 42 TAPE STOP
key w2 down
bar 43 WAH
key w2 up
key w6 down
bar 45 STUTTER
key w6 up
key w12 down
bar 46 SIREN
key w12 up
key w14 down
bar 48 RISER
key w14 up
key w15 down
bar 50 let go: the riser lands
key w15 up
release REC
bar 51 4. MAKE IT YOURS: HOME + SELECT, the tempo 122 to 116
press HOME
turn SELECT -6 150
release HOME
bar 52 KNOB 4: Drift, a chord every 2 bars
turn K4 -4 200
bar 53 ENV: the Chord page
tap ENV
bar 54 ALGORITHM: the voice Keys
turn ALGO 1 300
bar 56 ALGORITHM: the voice Bell
turn ALGO 3 300
bar 58 ENV again: its sound page; Colour
tap ENV
wait 500
turn K2 12 70
bar 59 Env
turn K4 15 70
bar 61 FX: the Space page; Feedback up
tap FX
wait 300
turn K3 14 80
bar 62 Echo time
turn K2 1 200
bar 64 EDIT: the Chords page; four slots
tap HOME
wait 200
tap EDIT
wait 600
tapkey w0
wait 200
turn K3 2 150
wait 300
turn K1 1 150
tapkey b2
wait 200
turn K3 2 150
wait 300
turn K1 1 150
tapkey w4
wait 200
turn K3 2 150
wait 300
turn K1 1 150
tapkey b1
wait 200
turn K2 -1 150
wait 200
turn K3 3 150
bar 67 the progression plays: Fm7, Bbm7, Cm7, AbM7
bar 72 SEQ x3: the drum pattern page; kick steps
tap EDIT
wait 300
tap SEQ
wait 250
tap SEQ
wait 250
tap SEQ
wait 800
tapkey w6
wait 300
tapkey w14
bar 74 the shaker
turn K1 1 200
wait 300
tapkey w1
wait 250
tapkey w9
bar 75 the rim
turn K1 2 200
wait 300
tapkey w4
wait 250
tapkey w12
bar 78 SAVE
tap SAVE
bar 79 HOME: the new piece playing
tap HOME
bar 84 END (fade over the last bars)
filmstop
wavstop
